/// known-gap: vm map literal is a Collection, and add_duration rejects it ("expected map, got collection")
/// add_duration adds a map of units (years, months, weeks, days, hours, minutes, seconds).
/// (The free-standing duration(n_seconds) constructor from the cheat sheet errors "not yet implemented" on both engines, so it is spec-only.)
dt | :from_iso("2025-03-04T10:20:30Z")
say(:add_duration(dt, {"days": 1, "hours": 2}))
say(:add_duration(dt, {"minutes": -30}))
say(:add_duration(dt, {"weeks": 1}))
